# Batch files reach cmd.exe with CRLF line endings on every checkout, whatever
# core.autocrlf says, and in GitHub's source zip. With LF alone cmd.exe can lose its
# place jumping to a label, and the standalone watchdog zip is compared byte for byte
# with the scripts beside it, which only holds if every checkout agrees.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The standalone watchdog zip carries this with CRLF, and is compared with it byte for byte.
LICENSE text eol=crlf

# Distributed as built; never converted.
*.zip binary
